## Draws a single pixel at integer coordinates.
##
## ## Parameters
## - `x`, `y`: the pixel position.
## - `color`: the pixel colour.
##
## ## Returns
## Nothing; the shape is drawn into the current frame.
##
## ## Notes
## Requires an active drawing frame (`BeginDrawing`/`EndDrawing`). Calling it outside one is undefined by raylib.
##
## ## Memory
## No allocation; a single direct C call.
##
## ## Example
## ```pengu
